                  want more variety?
                </h2> <div class="ae-2 text-block delay-200 margin-top-5" data-v-b63fc572><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div> <div class="fix-8-12" data-v-b63fc572><div data-v-723c9ce7 data-v-b63fc572><div class="plan-toggle-wrapper" data-v-723c9ce7><div class="checkbox plan-toggle" data-v-723c9ce7><label data-v-723c9ce7><span class="plan-toggle-label plan-toggle-label--left bold" data-v-723c9ce7>Monthly</span> <input type="checkbox" data-v-723c9ce7> <span class="element" data-v-723c9ce7></span> <span class="plan-toggle-label plan-toggle-label--right" data-v-723c9ce7>Yearly</span></label></div></div> <ul data-equal-collapse-width="767" class="grid grid-85 equal margin-top-3 ae-2 fromCenter relative membership-cards" data-v-723c9ce7></ul> <!----> <!----> <!----> <!----> <br data-v-723c9ce7> <br data-v-723c9ce7></div></div> <div class="fix-9-12 toCenter margin-top-5 margin-top-10" data-v-b63fc572><h2 class="h1 big ae-1 margin-bottom-2 done text-block">appreciated and mentioned</h2> <div class="ae-2 text-block delay-100 margin-top-5"><p class="opacity-8">Since its launch, The Absurd Project has found its way to people who felt something in its strange, expressive world.</p> <p class="opacity-8">Across the web, creators, publications, and curious voices have shared Absurd for the idea it carries: that beauty can be imperfect, full of character, and deeply human.</p></div> <ul class="flex grid-68 tintLogos equal equalMobile"><li class="text-block delay-200 col-2-12 col-tablet-1-4 col-phablet-1-3 col-phone-1-2"><div class="table wide ae-3"><div class="cell"><img width="100" height="22" data-src="/_nuxt/img/brand-68-smashing.d78f0a2.png" alt="Smashing Magazine" class="lazy"></div></div></li> <li class="text-block delay-400 col-2-12 col-tablet-1-4 col-phablet-1-3 col-phone-1-2"><div class="table wide ae-4"><div class="cell"><img width="110" height="19" data-src="/_nuxt/img/brand-68-iconfinder.bb2d122.png" alt="Iconfinder" class="lazy"></div></div></li> <li class